<title>ZIMBABWE: Barclays cuts lending rate to 26 pct.</title>
<headline>Barclays cuts lending rate to 26 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HARARE 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barclays Bank of Zimbabwe Ltd announced on Monday that it would reduce its minimum lending rate by three percentage points to 26 percent per annum with effect from February 13.</p>
<p>The Reserve Bank cut its rediscount rate to 23.5 percent from 27 percent earlier this month.</p>
<p>-- Harare newsroom +263-4 72 52 28/9</p>
</text>
